   "date": "2021-05-07",
   "text": "North Pacific Ocean Protection Act\n This bill prohibits the Department of the Interior from issuing a lease for the exploration, development, or production of oil or natural gas in specified areas of the Outer Continental Shelf off the coasts of Washington, Oregon, and California."
